%% title: Card verification · re-verification — Worldpay 3DS
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant GW as API gateway
    box rgb(219,234,254) ★ = built by me
    participant A as api-account ★
    end
    participant R as Redis
    participant W as Worldpay FraudSight
    participant N as api-notification
    U->>GW: Card verification request
    GW->>A: authorize
    A->>R: Check daily attempt count
    alt more than 3
        A-->>U: Daily limit reached
    else allowed
        A->>R: Increment + expiry (Lua · resets at UTC midnight)
        A->>W: Zero-amount payment · 3DS · FraudSight
        W-->>A: Device-data / challenge step
        A-->>U: 3DS step (supply-device-data · complete-challenge)
        U->>A: 3DS step completed
        A->>W: Final authorisation
        alt 4xx · fraudHighRisk
            W-->>A: User-side failure
            A->>A: Store rejection history
            A->>N: Failure notification
            A-->>U: 200 + outcome code
        else 5xx · unexpected response
            W-->>A: Vendor failure
            A->>R: Roll back attempt count
            A-->>U: Error · ask to retry
        else approved
            A->>A: Per-issuer circuit breaker (block) check
            A->>A: Store card token · history (part of card data encrypted)
            A-->>U: Success (credit level derived from holding a card)
        end
    end
    note over GW,W: Re-verification: same endpoint · no daily limit · updates re-verification status + approval/rejection notification
